'''Rei Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 406
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Rei Cat
|name2 = Ayanami Cat (TBC)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ayanami Cat (TBC)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Rei Cat's quick attacks with resistance basically makes her a slightly worse [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]]. If you don't have Rocker Cat, this is your closest bet. She can form a good shield when used alongside Rocker Cat, making her particularly helpful in [[Legend Stages#Crown Difficulty|4-crown]] stages. Using Research Up combos like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] is recommended when using her, as Rei Cat has a somewhat-long cooldown of 6.87 seconds.

She's also kind of like a slower, tankier [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Delivery Cat]]. Delivery Cat has 21 speed, while Rei has 8 speed. Although they both have similar health, Rei has resistant to angels. Overall, a pretty good pull.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

